This repository includes the 207-attribute bank derived from:

Sudeep Bhatia, Simon van Baal, Feiyi Wang, and Lukasz Walasek,
"Computational analysis of 100 K choice dilemmas: Decision attributes,
trade-off structures, and model-based prediction," PNAS 122(17),
e2406489122 (2025), https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2406489122.

The attribute data are preserved under the applicable MIT notice. Copyright
for the cited work remains with Sudeep Bhatia, Simon van Baal, and Lukasz
Walasek (2024). The referenced MiniLM model is not redistributed here; its
upstream Apache-2.0 terms apply. The article PDF is not included.

Upstream attribute source: https://osf.io/f29be/
Source file: Code and Data/2 - Vectorize Reasons/attributes.csv
The CSV is redistributed without modification. The projection and prototype
construction in this repository are adaptations described in docs/methods.md.

